      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Colleges_and_Universities_-_Johns_Hopkins_-_Johns_Hopkins_Hospital_nurses_stop_in_New_York_on_way_to_France_-_NARA_-_26426889.jpg",
      "width": 8052,
      "height": 5404,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "Public domain",
      "artist": "Underwood &amp; Underwood",
      "description": "Scope and content:  Original Caption: John Hopkins Hospital nurses stop in New York on way to France.  Group of nurses from the John Hopkins Hospital, Baltimore, Maryland, who spent their last few days in New York City before they left for service in France.  The unit was in charge of Miss Bessie Baker, and Majors Finney and Heysinger.\nDate Taken: 6/8/1917\n\nPhotographer: Underwood &amp; Underwood",
